{"results":[{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/db-orchid-suburbia/27415/project","title":"DB Orchid Suburbia, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![DB Realty developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/db-realty-group-542.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# DB Orchid Suburbia Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![DB Orchid Suburbia Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/db-orchid-suburbia-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-1140;h-350;crop;)\n\n**₹27,439 Per Sq. Ft Onwards**\n\n₹27,439 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider DB Orchid Suburbia?\n\n## About DB Orchid Suburbia, Kandivali West by DB Realty\n\nIntroducing DB Orchid Suburbia, a luxurious residential project located in the heart of Kandivali West. This upscale development offers a serene and peaceful environment perfect for those seeking a comfortable and stylish living experience. With its strategic location, the project provides easy access to major roads and amenities, making it an ideal choice for those who want to experience the best of urban living.\n\nThe project boasts a range of impressive amenities that cater to the modern lifestyle. Enjoy a healthy lifestyle with our state-of-the-art gymnasium, or rest assured with our 24x7 security system. The project s specification includes top-notch finishes and fittings, ensuring that every home is a perfect blend of form and function.\n\nDB Orchid Suburbia offers a range of spacious and tastefully designed apartments, including 2 BHK and 3 BHK options. With areas ranging from 870 Sq. Ft. to 1425 Sq. Ft., these homes are perfect for individuals and families looking for a comfortable and spacious living space.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at DB Orchid Suburbia:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 870 | On Request |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1425 | On Request |\n\nThis residential project is situated near significant landmarks that provide residents with easy access to essential amenities and services. These landmarks add to the quality of life, offering convenience and comfort.\n\nWe have total 27 options available in DB Orchid Suburbia for resale and rental, In resale we have 9 properties available ranging from 1 BHK - 3 BHK having sizes from 1.99 CR - 3.50 CR. For rent you can check 18 properties having options for 1 BHK - 3 BHK with price ranging from 30,000 - 74,000.\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Listing Type | Total Listings | Unit Type Range | Price Range |\n| Resale | 9 | 1 BHK - 3 BHK | 1.99 CR - 3.50 CR |\n| Rental | 18 | 1 BHK - 3 BHK | 30,000 - 74,000 |\n\nRecent government-registered transactions have revealed a stable rental market with a consistent rental rate of 65.875. Over the past three months, this figure has remained unchanged, with the current rate sitting at 32,142. In terms of sales, a total of 2 transactions were recorded during this period, resulting in a combined gross sales value of 3 Cr. Looking at the bigger picture, the rental rate has remained steady over the past six months, with a notable increase in sales transactions to 9, and a collective gross sales value of 22 Cr. Furthermore, analyzing the data over the past year reveals an even more striking trend, with 19 sales transactions registered and a total gross sales value of 44 Cr, providing a comprehensive insight into the transactional activity in the market.\n\n## DB Orchid Suburbia Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for DB Orchid Suburbia.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  870 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1425 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nDB Orchid Suburbia's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | DB Orchid Suburbia | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 34550 | 27000 |\n| Mar 2026 | 0 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 35600 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 0 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nDB Orchid Suburbia avg. price is ₹ 34.5 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-epsilon/7398/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon\") | ₹ 34,750 |\n| Current Project **DB Orchid Suburbia** | ₹ 34,550 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Astron](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-astron/8730/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Astron\") | ₹ 31,400 |\n| [Rustomjee Pinnacle](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rustomjee-pinnacle/103334/project \"Rustomjee Pinnacle\") | ₹ 30,250 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 27,000 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in DB Orchid Suburbia start from ₹ 56.3 K with options available for 2 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In DB Orchid Suburbia | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 35 K |\n| 2 BHK | ₹ 56.3 K | ₹ 49.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 75.6 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for DB Orchid Suburbia.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nRent in DB Orchid Suburbia ranges from ₹ 63 K to ₹ 90 K with options available for 2 BHK, 3 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for DB Orchid Suburbia moved from ₹ 30,150/sqft to ₹ 34,550/sqft, reflecting a 14.59% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for DB Orchid Suburbia moved from ₹ 30,150/sqft to ₹ 35,600/sqft, reflecting a 18.08% rise.\n\n## DB Orchid Suburbia Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 870 Sq. Ft. Apartment in DB Orchid Suburbia, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 1425 Sq. Ft. Apartment in DB Orchid Suburbia, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in DB Orchid Suburbia\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in DB Orchid Suburbia, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in DB Orchid Subu