://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/db-realty-group-542.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nDB Realty Developers started its journey in 2007, being founded by Shahid Balwa and Vinod Goenka. It develops duplexes, condominiums and other properties across northern and southern parts of Mumbai. The portfolio of DB Realty projects encompasses a gargantuan 17, 495 homes spreading over 45.2 acres in all. It has carved a niche in the mainstream realty segment over a short span of time, with new ventures in realty, hospitality, cluster redevelopment, commercial development, mass housing etc. One of India’s biggest real estate conglomerates, it is known for landmark projects like Orchid Suburbia, Crown, Orchid Heights, Ozone, Woods, etc. Pune has also transformed into a favorable hunting ground with several premium properties located here. An IPO was raised by the company in 2010 which helped raise a whopping INR 1, 500 crore as capital. With more than 20, 000 happy customers under its belt and a development index of 90 million sq. ft, it is currently one of Mumbai’s largest entities across multiple segments.\n\n![DB Orchid Crown residential project in Prabhadevi](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-db-orchid-crown-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPrabhadevi, Mumbai\n\n3, 4, 5 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![DB Realty Orchid Ozone residential project in Ketkipada](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-db-realty-orchid-ozone-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKetkipada, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 55.00 Lac to 82.93 Lac\n\n![DB Skypark residential project in Andheri East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-db-skypark-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.52 Cr to 4.22 Cr\n\n![DB Realty Skypark residential project in Andheri East](https://st